   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gender-IAFFE 2009-2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender-IAFFEE 2009-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IAFFE  - the International Association for Feminist Economics         advances feminist inquiry into economic issues. It educates           economists, policy makers, and the public on feminist view points on  economic issues. It promotes dialogue among researchers, activists,   and policy makers to improve policies. Holds an annual conference for current research, does advocacy work and publications. Core support.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IAFFE str&#xe4;var efter att includera kvinnors specifika fr&#xe5;gor i         finansiella sammanhang. Utbildar ekonomer, policy makers och          allm&#xe4;nheten f&#xf6;r att lyfta fram ett kvinnoperspektiv. fr&#xe4;mjar dialog   mellan forskare, aktivister och policy maker f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra        policies. Genomf&#xf6;r en &#xe5;rlig konferens och arbetar med p&#xe5;verkansarbete och publikationer.</narrative>
  </description>
